      "rationale": "A categorical crew-quality axis gives real grouping leverage for identifying key pain points. Well-grounded in the first two rows. However, rows 3-5 discuss reservation/rescheduling issues where crew quality is not actually described, yet the column asserts 'poor' — an unwarranted confident value where the text is silent, lowering groundedness."
